isation after negative trends.\nQuarterly revenue and PAT grew, but 9M PAT declined; rating upgraded to Hold by MarketsMojo.","summary":"Graphite India posted flat Q3 performance, showing stabilisation after negative trends.\nQuarterly revenue and PAT grew, but 9M PAT declined; rating upgraded to Hold by MarketsMojo.","url":"https://www.marketsmojo.com/news/stocks-in-action/graphite-india-ltd-reports-flat-quarterly-performance-amid-mixed-financial-trends-3829429","imageUrl":null,"pubDate":"2026-02-10T08:00:08","source":"Marketsmojo"},{"id":"479429","title":"Graphite India posts Q3 net profit of ₹680M, reversing ₹200M loss YoY.","summary":"Graphite India posts Q3 net profit of ₹680M, reversing ₹200M loss YoY.","url":"","imageUrl":null,"pubDate":"2026-02-09T13:12:50","source":"Livesquawk"},{"id":"462108","title":"Graphite India's credit rating by ICRA reaffirmed at AA+ (stable) for Rs. 1400 Cr working capital facilities.\nICRA also reaffirmed A1+ rating for Graphite India's Rs. 300 Cr commercial paper program.","summary":"Graphite India's credit rating by ICRA reaffirmed at AA+ (stable) for Rs. 1400 Cr working capital facilities.\nICRA also reaffirmed A1+ rating for Graphite India's Rs. 300 Cr commercial paper program.","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=cab0eb6b-7c3b-4527-b380-b8d75d46b321.pdf","imageUrl":null,"pubDate":"2026-01-30T19:32:45","source":"BSE"},{"id":"455999","title":"Graphite India's board approves ₹4,330 Cr investment in synthetic graphite anode materials for lithium-ion batteries.\nThe move aims to expand product range and create new revenue streams for the company.","summary":"Graphite India's board approves ₹4,330 Cr investment in synthetic graphite anode materials for lithium-ion batteries.\nThe move aims to expand product range and create new revenue streams for the company.","url":"","imageUrl":null,"pubDate":"2026-01-28T12:21:53","source":"Livesquawk"},{"id":"260114131655162","title":"Graphite India surged 7.1% intra